        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Passive.</strong> All creatures within 2 squares of the avatar — including allies — are subject to occasional Veil-thinning: at the start of their turn, on a 1 on a d10, they take 1d4 qliphothic Stress damage. The avatar does not control this and does not particularly notice it.</p><p><em>Being near them is its own debt.</em></p>",
